like magic missile would increase if the characters experience level
increases. Incidentally my XL:18 (or so) wizard has half a dozen spare
potions of gain level. Saving them for alchemy seems not necessary any
more (he has already ~300 HPs), so there's the two apparent options to
shortcut some levels on the ascension run with cursed potions of gain
level, or to enhance the experience level in case that spell efficiency
would be increased thereby. And the wizard is chaotic, BTW, so that the
force shouldn't be too bad to expect to shortcut some levels too often.
Any opinions? Will the magic missile spell efficiency (damage) increase
with experience level?

Ah, and I forgot; my wizard has the option to enhance a couple of spell
